<span class="token operator">></span> ipfs1       <span class="token operator">|</span> Daemon is ready
</code></pre></div></div></li> <li><p>Open a new terminal window.</p></li> <li><p>You can now interact with your cluster. In a new terminal window, navigate to the <code>ipfs-cluster-ctl</code> directory.</p></li> <li><p>List the peers within the cluster:</p> <div class="language-shell extra-class"><pre class="language-shell"><code>./ipfs-cluster-ctl peers <span class="token function">ls</span>

<span class="token operator">></span> 12D3KooWBaQ9SGtdnJmyS2fe7uq5gXQnejCf5ma2n9cUEbwVD5gf <span class="token operator">|</span> cluster2 <span class="token operator">|</span> Sees <span class="token number">2</span> other peers
