<span class="token operator">></span> - /ip4/127.0.0.1/tcp/9096/p2p/12D3KooWBaQ9SGtdnJmyS2fe7uq5gXQnejCf5ma2n9cUEbwVD5gf
<span class="token operator">></span> - /ip4/172.18.0.5/tcp/9096/p2p/12D3KooWBaQ9SGtdnJmyS2fe7uq5gXQnejCf5ma2n9cUEbwVD5gf
<span class="token operator">></span> <span class="token punctuation">..</span>.
